# step08  batch diagnostic and leave-out tests
# step09  figures and tables
# step10  additional analyses (null grid, B = 1999, k/p, simulations, comparisons)
# step11  IDR, leave-out tests (B = 999), extra simulation scenarios
# step12  exact estimates over all splits, SEQC C vs D, power simulation
# step13  rho test versus a raw-agreement test (unequal replicate noise)
# step14  TIF copies of the figures for journal submission
# =====================================================================

